  "prefLabel": "Plc 2001.04 Definitions Incorporated",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2001.04 Definitions Incorporated. All terms used in these rules relative to procedures, applications, inspections, and fees that are defined in Plc 102, Plc 202, Plc 302, Plc 402, or Plc 1000 shall have the meaning specified therein.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
